{"3642440":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Luxman Moonlit Market","steam_appid":3642440,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/d169f679155fea08775ffc4a1091f9cc.poster.avif?t=1780976359\" width=1000 height=354 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/d169f679155fea08775ffc4a1091f9cc.webm?t=1780976359\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/d169f679155fea08775ffc4a1091f9cc.mp4?t=1780976359\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you must earn enough coins to pay rent to the region’s landlord or risk bankruptcy. With ever-changing market trends and unique regional conditions, adapt your strategies on each journey, chain powerful synergies, and optimize your night market to perfection to help Luxman build the world’s most famous night market!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/13a4f9cc6323af397306c9014fc958a9.poster.avif?t=1780976359\" width=1000 height=354 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/13a4f9cc6323af397306c9014fc958a9.webm?t=1780976359\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/13a4f9cc6323af397306c9014fc958a9.mp4?t=1780976359\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spatial set-collection strategy<\/strong> – Master market composition by strategically placing 6 types of attractions.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt to market trends<\/strong> – Analyze trend charts to fulfill visitor demands, fend off thugs, and tackle unique regional challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage powerful items<\/strong> – Push your luck with exotic Charms and manipulate spaces &amp; crowds with evolving Voucher powers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat, no enemies, only demanding landlords to satisfy<\/strong> – Discover 11 unique landlords and uncover their intriguing stories.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An in-depth journey<\/strong> – Conquer 7 difficulties and explore endless possibilities with seeded journeys.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/fd4d19885017bc95240f56305ad313c1.poster.avif?t=1780976359\" width=1000 height=260 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/fd4d19885017bc95240f56305ad313c1.webm?t=1780976359\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/fd4d19885017bc95240f56305ad313c1.mp4?t=1780976359\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your perfect night market with different Trucks, Charms, Vouchers, and the Bluprint Workshop. Ignite a combo frenzy, stack game-changing synergies, and optimize your layout to turn fortune in your favor!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3642440\/extras\/eab1ca0faba5e363ccc9d2568856f936.poster.avif?t=1780976359\" width=1000 height=2